"Display changes apply immediately, also while a game is running. The in-game layout moves the on-screen controls out of the screens' way in landscape. Render resolution resizes the layer at once, but the internal 3D render scale is applied when a game loads: reload or restart a running game to use it." = "显示设置会立即生效，游戏运行中也一样。横屏时游戏内布局会把屏幕按键移到不遮挡画面的位置。渲染分辨率会立即调整图层大小，但内部 3D 渲染倍率在载入游戏时生效：运行中的游戏需要重新载入或重启后才会使用。";
